EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# USDA FoodData Central (add-item flow's 4th search source, raw/generic foods OpenFoodFacts
# doesn't cover). DEMO_KEY is a real, USDA-documented no-registration fallback -- functional but
# rate-limited (~30 req/hour/IP vs ~1,000/hour registered) -- and is what shared/src/usdaFoodData.ts
# falls back to if this is unset, so leaving it commented out is fine for local dev. Before any real
# production traffic, register a free key (one-time, no approval wait) at https://api.data.gov/signup/
# and set it here.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_USDA_FDC_API_KEY=DEMO_KEY
